  "note": "Election of the fifteen members of the Ballymena Urban Council in three wards of five seats each, polled Monday 15 January 1923. All three wards were contested, eight candidates standing in each. 1,204 of 1,400 voters polled (86 per cent); 13 spoiled papers."
